meta {
  name: 11-Browse public listings, hunting for owners I could pitch
  type: http
  seq: 11
}

get {
  url: {{host}}/api/listings?page=0&size=20
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{emeka_jwt}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 200
}

docs {
  As an agent looking for work, I want to find listings WITHOUT an
  assigned agent so I can DM the owner and pitch myself. The browse
  endpoint takes a `pageable` only — no filter for "no agent",
  no filter for city / Port Harcourt, no filter for property type.

  GAP: This is the single biggest miss for an agent persona. I can't
  prospect on this platform, period.
}
